**B. Lock/Unlock & Drag-and-Drop Logic + ROLLBACK SAFETY:**
```javascript
toggleLock() {
  const state = WARD_STATE.processes;
  
  if (state.isLocked) {
    // UNLOCKING: Take snapshot first for potential rollback
    state.originalSnapshot = [...this.currentData]; 
    state.isLocked = false;
    
    const lockBtn = document.getElementById('btn-proc-lock');
    lockBtn.innerText = '🔓';
    lockBtn.title = 'Lock to Save Order';
    
